#    a positive accidental confirmation that the W44-152 path also helps
#    codec_wiki d=3 cluster (W44-121 documented -2.7 to -3.4 SSIM2 deficit).
#    Investigate to determine whether the W44-152 path should be promoted
#    to handle codec_wiki d=3 explicitly OR widened to d=3 cluster.
#
# 4. **ROOT-CAUSE BUTTLOOP MEASUREMENT DIVERGENCE** (HIGHEST EV long-term,
#    HIGH risk, multi-week, cross-crate) — would obsolete the entire
#    W44-105/107/108/109/117/120/140/142/143/148/152 chain. Documented
